Allow network access

A Todo has an id which is an integer, a title which is a string, and a completed which is a boolean

To CountDone, given a url which is a string, returning an integer
    the response is fetch JSON from the url
    the todos are the response as a list of Todo
    the done are the todos where the completed is equal to true
    say "{the count of the done} of {the count of the todos} are done"
    return the count of the done
